{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying the equality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/5/8e5ca9b8c6ffa8d035eab4f1adf4d9c65248afbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x+2|=2|x-2|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/7/c27f3545c920f312333444388446ea5ea5f184d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{1}{3}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{2}{3}\\quad \\text{(C) } 6\\quad \\text{(D) } 6\\tfrac{1}{3}\\quad \\text{(E) } 6\\tfrac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"292\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are three cases: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\n(i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b19ba2a5419dd536d67cff97702d78576142c6fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+2), (x-2) \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\n(ii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/a/49ae408a815379f30a2452e60bcf13120fdeb30b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2 \\geq 0, x-2&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\n(iii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d9d19064598c2142fc269bf605c68b35891f50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+2), (x-2)&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"155\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\nIn case (i), we solve the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/b/20b90154c2f6eb38817fd203486aa73cb262aab9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2=2(x-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd92d02476c3434bf645bf5a3bc249eca83d3c16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. In case (ii), we solve the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/b/b1b7adaaf8ec06b44d507393dee7e557323caf92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2=2(2-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/540f95e8ada46bee5f8772cc41ab3b35e4884aa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />. Case (iii) simply produces an equation which is that of case (i) multiplied on both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so it yields the same solutions and thus may be discarded. Thus, if we add the real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> which satisfy the original equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d0494d5bacacc3d0cc11542605bd85859f81def6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+\\frac{2}{3}=6\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"93\" height=\"38\" />, or answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\